Cell["COMPLETE VERIFICATION V6 - 20260923", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"13b48ff5-3f8c-445a-b1e7-0f19757ff873"],

Cell["\<\
Mathematica 12. Extract this entire package into a new folder. Quit the old \
kernel before running. Choose Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook. No old \
verification files are needed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1bdf6c74-9850-4e70-ae02-7d6c66413812"],

Cell["\<\
The first output must begin COMPLETE VERIFICATION V6 (20260923). This \
main suite requires 13 stable-ID units and 550 assertions. Supplemental \
units listed in the repository README run separately. The v5/v6 names \
are stable program identifiers, not manuscript versions. Save this \
notebook after evaluation. Results are written into \
mathematica/chapters/verification_results_v6.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9615894e-2eb8-4d78-a931-001a2bd2fffa"],

